+/* Resolve blit on the GPU. The title's camera target is rendered into a GL texture and its guest
+ * storage mirror stays empty (measured: the CPU census of the mirror read zero after real draws), so a
+ * CPU copy can only ever resolve zeros. This blit reads the GPU texture and writes the destination
+ * texture, both through the driver, and restores the framebuffer binding it found. */
