+/* Byte-exact synchronous read using private disk-backed interior pages.
+ * Caller proves exclusive unpinned output pages and serializes VM changes.
+ * Return 1 mapped, 0 no VM change (use pread), -1 failed destructive commit
+ * (caller MUST stop; Linux MAP_FIXED failure need not preserve old mappings).
