+/* Update v327680 (metadata v24) UpRender / Screen observation.
+ *
+ * Measured on device: the guest answers Unity's Screen::get_width/height with
+ * 1920x1080 although the panel is 1280x720, so UpRender sizes its camera target
+ * and the guest builds a 1080p swapchain, which the runtime then crops to
