+ *
+ * Four pinned sites of UpRender.UpdateTexture:
+ *   0x13963d8  ldp w8,w9,[x19,#0x20]  the component's aspect pair (16:9)
+ *   0x13965a0  bl  0x18f0b80          camera-target build (observation only)
+ *   0x13963e8  str w0,[x19,#0x60]     stores Screen::get_width() result
+ *   0x13963fc  str w0,[x19,#0x64]     stores Screen::get_height() result
